### Theorem FL.1 — sharp external-shell floor from Favard

For `h<=pi D/2`,

\[
\boxed{
Z_{ext}
\ge
n-
\frac{2D^2}{\sqrt3}\mathcal L(h/D)
-h-1.
}
\tag{FL.7}
\]

This improves ZX.1, which used the weaker area bound `h^2/pi`.
